\cf2 Load test results:\
Local load tests using transactional producing saw between 600-800 kafka messages being sent per second.\
Mongo db results for processing 10 000 trade allocations were: 10 seconds to insert 1000, 45 seconds to query by trade allocation id, and 10 seconds to update the status and save them again.\
This was further improved by adding indexes to groupId and TradeAllocationId in the respective Tradeallocation and TradeGroupstatus tables, which increased performance to 10 000 records:\
insert : 10 sec, query = 5 seconds, update = 4 seconds.\
